sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Visitor
    participant W as Next.js
    participant A as API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as maintenance queue

    V->>W: clicks "Try demo"
    W->>A: POST /v1/auth/demo (+ Turnstile token)
    A->>A: rate-limit: 3 demos / IP / hour
    A->>DB: TRANSACTION: create demo User + Org (isDemo, expires 24h)<br/>clone seed: 3 members, 25 tasks, 6 clients, 10 invoices
    A-->>W: accessToken + refresh cookie (same as normal login)
    W-->>V: dashboard with X-ray panel open + guided tour
    Note over A: Demo guardrails: emails routed to in-app outbox,<br/>Stripe test mode only, upload cap 2 MB, no API key export
    Q->>DB: hourly: delete orgs where isDemo AND demoExpiresAt < now()
